  "producer_and_policy_proofs": {
    "creation_gate": "Both process-wide DX12 entry points call the same actual creation::lock before any D3D12 action; poison returns a stable error and is never cleared. The state/gate extraction initially preserves original recovery semantics for a genuine red portable regression.",
    "gpu_selection": "All raw Metal test constructors in tests.rs/scan_tests.rs/coarse_tests.rs/coarse_routes.rs use shared gpu_support::options; NativeContextOptions::default remains None for valid public selection. Unit tests require TILEINK_NATIVE_GPU; integration Gpu helper separately requires TILEINK_TEST_GPU. No alias or default substitution added.",
    "gpu_regression_development": "The first child invocation included the crate prefix and ran zero tests, producing an invalid green. Saved in policy-gpu-harness-zero-case.log. Corrected exact name and asserted one executed test before accepting red reproduction. Corrected test fails with the old default selection, and passes missing/empty/unavailable cases after fix.",
    "uniform_producer": "Resource::Buffer has one production constructor, ComputeBatch::buffer, which rejects empty/non-word-aligned bytes; resources() returns immutable slice. immutable_uniforms excludes storage aliases/readbacks. Uniforms::new reserves/pads/writes nonempty data before assigning Some(offset). Resources::record builds the upload from the same arena before consuming offsets. A Some offset thus owns a required upload resource.",
    "required_optional_semantics": "Sampler/table handle absence is valid; storage/readback-alias constants bind their own buffer from zero. Vulkan diagnostic Vec recovery preserves FFI non-unwinding/message/teardown reporting semantics, not mutable native creation state.",
    "scope": "Permanent error/ownership/test configuration cleanup; no shader or Metal production path changes; no rendering speed claim. Actual DX12 GPU execution/performance remains platform-limited."
  },
